{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17781","headline":"春日奉献圣寿无疆词十首 八 · 杨巨源","name":"春日奉献圣寿无疆词十首 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"物象朝高殿，簪裾溢上京。\n春当九衢好，天向万方明。\n乐报箫韶发，杯看沆瀣生。\n芙蓉丹阙暖，杨柳玉楼晴。\n阊阖开中禁，衣裳俨太清。\n南山同圣寿，长对凤皇城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17781.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17781","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}